msgctxt "64"
msgid "Date-san! What happened? Are you hurt!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Dammit... That bastard slipped away from me... And he's still got Mama with "
"him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"He mentioned going somewhere that would bring back memories... Could that "
"be...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Yeah... Probably where he shot Keisuke."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Where did it happen? I'll go get Mama back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Don't be stupid, Kiryu. This is my problem, so I need to be\r\n"
"the one to solve it. You shouldn't get involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Date-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Sorry, Kiryu. But I need to take care of this one alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"If I don't, I'll never have peace of mind... Not about Keisuke, and not "
"about the woman I love."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Date-san... Don't get yourself killed."
msgstr ""

